# Build outputs — rebuilt inside the image, and copying them in invalidates the layer cache
# on every local build while risking host-built binaries leaking into the container.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Local runtime state
**/uploads/
**/*.user
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/

# Never ship secrets into an image layer
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/.env
**/*.pfx

# Optional model and OCR assets are mounted or downloaded, not baked in
**/Models/onnx/*.onnx
**/Models/onnx/vocab.txt
**/tessdata/*.traineddata

# Tests are not needed in the runtime image
RAGnosis.Tests/
